      "media": {
        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00201:alt:fig-00001-alt",
          "text": "Hydrogen bonding in alcohols in which oxygen and hydrogen carry delta-negative and delta-positive charges, respectively. The figure shows hydrogen bonding between two ball-and-stick models of methanol in electrostatic potential map."
