      "caption": null,
      "media": {
        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00201:alt:fig-00006-alt",
          "text": "Tert-butyl alcohol reacts with potassium to form potassium tert-butoxide. Methanol with sodium hydride forms sodium methoxide. Ethanol with sodamide forms sodium ethoxide. Cyclohexanol with methylmagnesium bromide forms bromomagnesium cyclohexanolate."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_17_02_007.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
      }
    },
